headline:"Calm Studios scales the Calmlings wellness universe with Gemini API",bv:"Calm Studios integrates Nano Banana and Veo models to develop wellness-minded entertainment, amassing over 1.5 billion video views and 4 million social media followers in less than six months.",Gf:[{name:"Jesper Gustavsson",role:"VP, Product Management"},{name:"Anastasia Avramenko",role:"Head of Marketing & Growth"},{name:"Christopher Scoville",role:"Consultant"},{name:"Sean Webster",role:"Consultant"}],thumbnail:{src:"https://www.gstatic.com/aistudio/case_studies/calm_studios/calmstudios_thumbnail.png",
type:"image",alt:"Calm Studios showcase hero"}}},{type:"cta",content:{link:"https://aistudio.google.com/prompts/new_chat?model=gemini-3-pro-image"}},{type:"text",content:{body:'\n            <p>\n              \u201cWe founded Calm Studios to make the world happier and healthier through human-led, AI-accelerated entertainment. Tied to the ethos of the Calm app, our entertainment company complements sleep, meditation, and relaxation activities with Calmlings \u2014 delightful characters designed to help users build healthy habits,\u201d say co-founders Michael Acton-Smith and Alex Tew.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              To realize the vision of blending mindfulness with high-quality multimedia content, <a href="https://calmstudios.com/">Calm Studios</a> needed to scale their creative output. By integrating Gemini and Veo models into their production pipeline, the team accelerates video development and unlocks new product offerings to reach millions of users around the world.\n            </p>'}},
{type:"video",content:{video:{sources:[{url:"https://www.gstatic.com/aistudio/case_studies/calm_studios/calmstudios_calmlings-veo.mp4",type:"video/mp4"}]}}},{type:"text",content:{header:{headline:"<h2>Bringing characters to life with Nano Banana and Veo</h2>"},body:'\n            <p>\n              Calm Studios integrates <a href="https://aistudio.google.com/models/gemini-3-pro-image">Nano Banana</a> to develop the visual foundations for the Calmlings universe, conceptualizing both the central characters and the immersive environments they inhabit. They also use the model to prototype physical products, such as character plushes, enabling the team to envision the Calmlings in entirely new ways.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              The team uses <a href="https://aistudio.google.com/models/veo-3">Veo</a> to seamlessly translate the static concepts developed through Nano Banana into engaging, emotionally resonant audiovisual content with high fidelity. Veo helps characters lead breathing exercises, recite affirmations, and spread positivity to a wellness-minded audience. Within a five-month period, these videos have amassed over 1 billion views and reached millions of followers across TikTok, YouTube, Instagram, and Facebook.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              Building on the success of their short-form video assets, the team is building an interactive gaming experience designed to practice self-care by taking care of Calmlings, with long-term aspirations of expanding this wellness universe into a full-length feature film.\n            </p>'}},
{type:"images",content:{items:[{image:{src:"https://www.gstatic.com/aistudio/case_studies/calm_studios/calmstudios_calmlings-socialfeed.png",alt:"Calmlings receive millions of views on Instagram"}}]}},{type:"quote",content:{quote:"We\u2019ve used Nano Banana and Veo to produce over 500 videos for our social media accounts. We see these models as a pillar of our Calmlings wellness universe and a key part of our product roadmap.",author:"- Anastasia Avramenko, Head of Marketing & Growth at Calm Studios"}},
{type:"text",content:{header:{headline:"<h2>Harmonizing qualitative and quantitative analysis with Gemini 3 Pro</h2>"},body:"\n            <p>\n              To sustain their rapid growth and consistently engage their audience, Calm Studios developed an AI agent system powered by Gemini 3 Pro to aid in their overarching social media strategy.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              The team\u2019s multi-agent framework uses the model to analyze social media posts by processing raw video inputs alongside text descriptions and transcripts, then combining this qualitative data with quantitative performance metrics. This pipeline enables the agents to identify themes, brainstorm new content ideas, and create storyboards. The system can then pass these concepts back to Nano Banana and Veo to generate visuals.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              Beyond content strategy, they cite Gemini 3 Pro\u2019s Deep Research and Search capabilities to perform complex market analysis and technical deep-dives.\n            </p>"}},
{type:"text",content:{header:{headline:"<h2>The future of mindful entertainment</h2>"},body:"\n            <p>\n              Calm Studios is uniquely positioned to deliver mindful entertainment for a global audience. By integrating generative AI models for everything from high-quality asset creation to strategic planning, the studio demonstrates how a playful and purposeful approach to wellness can effectively scale to millions of users worldwide.\n            </p>"}},{type:"text",content:{body:'\n            <p>\n              To get started with the Gemini API, read the <a href="https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api">developer documentation</a>.\n            </p>'}},
{type:"related_cases",content:{Jg:["wolffun-game","instalily","holywater"]}}]},{title:"AddGlow",bg:"AddGlow helps fashion brands generate catalog-ready assets to expand their reach and drive revenue growth",slug:"addglow",Xg:"https://aistudio.google.com/prompts/new_chat?model=gemini-3-pro-image",thumbnail:{url:"https://www.gstatic.com/aistudio/case_studies/addglow/addglow_backgrounds.webp",alt:"AddGlow showcase preview"},nf:["Gemini 3 Pro Image","Gemini Flash-Lite"],modules:[{type:"hero",content:{date:"April 27, 2026",
headline:"From months to a day: Accelerating fashion photo production with Gemini 3 Pro Image",bv:"AddGlow helps fashion brands and retailers bypass the logistical bottlenecks of traditional photoshoots, providing a retail-specific dashboard specifically designed for enterprise-scale creative production.",Gf:[{name:"Ina Herlihy",role:"Founder and CEO, AddGlow"}],thumbnail:{src:"https://www.gstatic.com/aistudio/case_studies/addglow/addglow_backgrounds.webp",type:"image",alt:"AddGlow image generation"}}},
{type:"cta",content:{link:"https://aistudio.google.com/prompts/new_chat?model=gemini-3-pro-image"}},{type:"text",content:{body:"\n            <p>\n              AddGlow helps fashion brands and retailers bypass the logistical bottlenecks of traditional photoshoots, providing a retail-specific dashboard specifically designed for enterprise-scale creative production. By integrating Gemini 3 Pro into its high-fidelity imaging pipeline, AddGlow brings uncompromising quality to every asset they generate while providing the agility required to meet the demands of the modern retail landscape.\n            </p>"}},
{type:"text",content:{header:{headline:"<h2>Maintaining production quality for image generation</h2>"},body:"\n            <p>\n              Ensuring accuracy to the garment is the highest priority for AddGlow, which counts popular brands like Elliatt, Mac Duggal, and Alex Apparel as clients. The team found that many AI models would struggle with hallucinations, altering critical details like button styles, necklines, or fabric textures. These inconsistencies erode customer trust, making automated solutions difficult to implement for production-ready work.\n            </p>"}},
{type:"images",content:{items:[{image:{src:"https://www.gstatic.com/aistudio/case_studies/addglow/addglow_poses.webp",alt:"AddGlow\u2019s pose catalog"},legend:"AddGlow\u2019s pose catalog"}]}},{type:"text",content:{body:"\n            <p>\n              AddGlow addresses this precision gap by leveraging Gemini 3 Pro Image\u2019s multimodal reasoning capabilities and multiple reference images. To ensure accuracy across thousands of unique SKUs, AddGlow developed a sophisticated pipeline that adapts to the physical characteristics of different items and generates high-quality outputs:\n            </p>\n            <ul>\n              <li><b>Automated pre-analysis:</b> The platform uses Gemini Flash-Lite to extract essential metadata from reference inputs, such as garment type, viewing angle, and fabric traits, and structure the prompt accordingly.</li>\n              <li><b>JSON schema grounding:</b> This approach constrains model output to validated, machine-readable data, eliminating the need for manual intervention.</li>\n              <li><b>Human oversight:</b> Every generation includes a human approval step to verify accuracy, ensuring that the final output meets brand-specific creative standards.</li>\n            </ul>"}},
{type:"quote",content:{quote:"Details matter. Without Gemini, we wouldn\u2019t be able to execute on any of our GenAI photo use cases. It\u2019s the only model that meets our quality bar.",author:"\u2014 Ina Herlihy, Founder & CEO of AddGlow"}},{type:"text",content:{header:{headline:"<h2>Accelerating creative output, driving revenue</h2>"},body:"\n            <p>\n              A significant challenge in bringing garments to market is the logistics required for specialized imagery, such as ghost mannequin photography. Traditionally this entailed separate, dedicated sessions where clothing is photographed on a specialized form that is later edited out. The process is expensive, slow, and often requires weeks of retouching.\n            </p>"}},
{type:"text",content:{body:"\n            <p>\n              AddGlow overcomes these pitfalls by allowing high-volume retailers and luxury fashion brands to generate images from existing photography, significantly reducing the turnaround time for new product launches. Shari Hoenig, VP Ecommerce & Marketing at Alex Apparel Group, notes that AddGlow has \u201cstreamlined the \u2018micro-logistics\u2019 of ecommerce photography by bridging the gap between major campaign shoots and smaller-scale website updates, saving three days of planning and cleanup per cycle.\u201d\n            </p>"}},
{type:"images",content:{items:[{image:{src:"https://www.gstatic.com/aistudio/case_studies/addglow/addglow_ghostmannequin.webp",alt:"Ghost mannequin images produced from existing Mac Duggal model shots"},legend:"Ghost mannequin images produced from existing Mac Duggal model shots"}]}},{type:"text",content:{body:"\n            <p>\n              Beyond logistical efficiency, brands face the constant need for fresh content to support multiple marketing channels. Previously, brands were often locked into the specific poses captured during a single shoot. AddGlow allows users to focus on capturing core angles, then leverage Gemini Pro Image to generate a wide range of unique poses and backgrounds. \u201cIt gives us more flexibility in presenting products across different channels,\u201d says Emily Greenfield, Head of eCommerce at Mac Duggal. This ability to scale asset creation broadens the opportunity for paid media experimentation, which in turn lifts conversion rates and drives revenue. Nicky Bennett, Head of Ecommerce at ELLIATT, explains, \u201cEven a modest increase in conversion, paired with higher image volume across SKUs, has a meaningful impact on revenue.\u201d\n            </p>"}},
{type:"images",content:{items:[{image:{src:"https://www.gstatic.com/aistudio/case_studies/addglow/addglow_backgrounds.webp",alt:"How Elliatt replicates an on-location photoshoot"},legend:"How Elliatt replicates an on-location photoshoot"}]}},{type:"text",content:{header:{headline:"<h2>Fine-grained control with Google AI Studio</h2>"},body:'\n            <p>\n              AddGlow found that Google AI Studio provides the tools to maintain a consistent, production-grade aesthetic through controls for aspect ratio and native 4K resolution support. They aim to expand AI-driven offerings to even more complex tasks, such as transforming design illustrations directly into photorealistic images, promising even new ways to scale creative production.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              Read the Gemini API documentation to start building with <a href="https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/image-generation">Gemini Pro</a>.\n            </p>'}},
{type:"related_cases",content:{Jg:["calm-studios","holywater","wolffun-game"]}}]},{title:"Wolffun Game",bg:"Wolffun Game accelerates PvP game development using Gemini models to reason through complex game logic and drive creative production",slug:"wolffun-game",Xg:"https://aistudio.google.com/prompts/new_chat?model=gemini-pro-latest",thumbnail:{url:"https://www.gstatic.com/aistudio/case_studies/wolffun/wolffun-thumbnail.jpg",alt:"Wolffun Game showcase preview"},nf:["Gemini 2.5 Pro","Gemini 2.5 Flash Image"],
modules:[{type:"hero",content:{date:"February 18, 2026",headline:"Wolffun Game Studio accelerates PvP game development with Gemini 2.5 Flash Image and 2.5 Pro",bv:"By integrating Gemini API models and tools into development workflows, Wolffun automates engineering tasks, optimizes game logic, and enhances creative production for award-winning games like Thetan Immortal.",Gf:[{name:"Nguyen Dinh Khanh",role:"CEO, Wolffun Game"}],thumbnail:{src:"",type:"image",alt:"Wolffun Game showcase hero"}}},{type:"stats",
content:{stats:[{value:"90%",description:"Reduction in code review time for senior engineers"},{value:"40%",description:"Increase in creative asset production"}]}},{type:"cta",content:{link:"https://aistudio.google.com/prompts/new_chat?model=gemini-pro-latest"}},{type:"text",content:{body:'\n            <p>\n              Founded in 2014, <a href="https://www.wolffungame.com/">Wolffun Game Studio</a> has established itself as a pioneer in mobile online PvP games. From early hits like the blockchain phenomenon Thetan Arena, which garnered over 30 million players, to its latest 1 v. 1 archery combat game, Thetan Immortal, Wolffun pushes the boundaries of competitive gaming for a global audience.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              Wolffun chose Gemini API for its versatile model family, using Gemini 2.5 Pro and 2.5 Flash Image to help accelerate development cycles by reducing code review time and boosting creative output.\n            </p>'}},
{type:"youtube_video",content:{video:{lN:"JXlkyFrGn4g",legend:"Thetan Immortal won Google Play\u2019s 2025 \u2018Best Made in Vietnam\u2019 Award."}}},{type:"text",content:{header:{headline:"<h2>From game logic to dialogue: Building experiences with Gemini 2.5 Pro</h2>"},body:"\n            <p>\n              Game development is an intricate dance between rapid iteration, technical complexity, and creative excellence. Traditional bottlenecks \u2013 from time-consuming code reviews and exhaustive technical research to repetitive content generation \u2013 can slow down progress and divert valuable developer time away from innovation.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              The Wolffun team leverages advanced, long context reasoning in Gemini 2.5 Pro for:\n            </p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>\n                <b>Source code analysis:</b> The team built an automated GitHub bot that analyzes entire codebases to suggest shader optimizations and refactor legacy systems\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <b>Game design & balancing:</b> The model creates complex documentation and balancing formulas, analyzing historical player match data to calculate bot difficulty curves, and generating concepts for game mechanics\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <b>Engineering tasks:</b> The model automates high-level engineering tasks and debugs existing code, going beyond simple code completion\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <b>Story development and localization:</b> The model generates rich backstories and dialogues in 8 languages, tracking cultural nuances so they are more accurately conveyed.\n              </li>\n            </ul>"}},
{type:"images",content:{items:[{image:{src:"https://www.gstatic.com/aistudio/case_studies/wolffun/wolffun-inline-small.jpg",alt:"The Wolffun team uses proprietary tools, including a metadata tool and automated GitHub bot, that integrate Gemini models."},legend:"The Wolffun team uses proprietary tools, including a metadata tool and automated GitHub bot, that integrate Gemini models."}]}},{type:"text",content:{body:"\n            <p>\n              The automated review tools have helped to reduce code review time by 50% for junior developers and up to 90% for senior developers, allowing lead engineers to focus on architecture and innovation. Complex tasks like calculating difficulty scaling formulas, which previously took days of manual calculation, are now handled in minutes by 2.5 Pro.\n            </p>"}},
{type:"quote",content:{quote:"The performance of Gemini 2.5 Pro in tasks requiring complex reasoning, coding, and problem-solving demonstrated a clear advantage. For a game studio, the ability to efficiently handle tasks like performance optimization and complex game logic generation is a decisive advantage.",author:"\u2014 Nguyen Dinh Khanh, CEO of Wolffun Game"}},{type:"text",content:{header:{headline:"<h2>Generating concept art Gemini 2.5 Flash Image</h2>"},body:"\n            <p>\n              Beyond code, Wolffun uses Gemini 2.5 Flash Image for rapid visual brainstorming and asset creation. The team noted that integrating the model boosted efficiency by 40% and banner production by 35-40%, accelerating time-to-market for marketing campaigns.\n            </p>"}},
{type:"images",content:{items:[{image:{src:"https://www.gstatic.com/aistudio/case_studies/wolffun/wolffun-demo.gif",alt:"Gemini 2.5 Flash Image generates new character art from a reference image."},legend:"Gemini 2.5 Flash Image generates new character art from a reference image."}]}},{type:"text",content:{body:"\n            <p>\n              The team appreciated that \u201cthe availability of models like Gemini 2.5 Flash and 2.5 Flash-Lite gives us the flexibility to choose the right balance of performance and cost for high-volume tasks like player support, making our AI integration financially sustainable.\u201d\n            </p>"}},
{type:"text",content:{header:{headline:"<h2>Powering the next generation of personalized gaming</h2>"},body:"\n            <p>\n              Looking ahead, Wolffun views Gemini models as a foundational technology for hyper-personalized gaming experiences. They also plan to build AI-generated content pipelines to create real-time, personalized quests or in-game events based on a player\u2019s recent actions, delivering a unique game world to the individual.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              Wolffun\u2019s success underscores the immense potential for AI to help revolutionize game development, empowering teams to build faster, innovate more freely, and ultimately deliver more engaging experiences to players worldwide.\n            </p>"}},
